        <div class="element-introduction">

            <section>
                <h2>1. Introduction</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with Republic Act No. 10173, also known as the Data Privacy Act of 2012, and its applicable implementing rules and regulations.
                </p>

                <p>
                    This Privacy Policy explains how Regalla collects, uses, stores, and protects personal information when you visit our website, browse our T-shirt collections, place an order through email, or contact us with inquiries.
                </p>

                <p>
                    By using our website, you acknowledge the practices described in this Privacy Policy.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla may collect the following information when you interact with our website or contact us:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Personal Information: Your name and email address when you place an order or send us an inquiry.</li>

                    <li>Order Information: The T-shirt you wish to purchase, your selected size, quantity, and other details necessary to process your order.</li>

                    <li>Communication Information: Information you voluntarily include in messages sent to Regalla through email or our contact form.</li>

                    <li>Technical Information: Basic information about your device, browser, and website usage, if collected through the website's technical systems.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    We only request information relevant to responding to inquiries and handling customer orders.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla may use your personal information for the following purposes:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>To receive and process your T-shirt order inquiries.</li>
                    <li>To confirm product selections, sizes, quantities, and other order details.</li>
                    <li>To communicate with you regarding your order or questions.</li>
                    <li>To respond to customer concerns and provide assistance.</li>
                    <li>To maintain website functionality and improve the browsing experience.</li>
                    <li>To comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Regalla does not require customers to create an account or use an online payment gateway to submit an order through the website.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>4. How Orders Work</h2>

                <p>
                    When you select the “Order Now” button, your email application opens with the relevant order details prepared for you to review and send.
                </p>

                <p>
                    You may need to provide your name, email address, selected product, size, quantity, and other information necessary to complete your order inquiry.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Please review your message before sending it. Your order is not considered submitted until you send the email. Regalla may contact you to confirm availability and clarify the details of your request.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>5. Sharing and Disclosure of Information</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla does not sell your personal information to third parties.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Your information may be disclosed when reasonably necessary to:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Respond to your requests and process your order inquiries.</li>
                    <li>Use essential service providers that support website operations or communications, where applicable.</li>
                    <li>Comply with applicable laws, valid legal processes, or lawful government requests.</li>
                    <li>Protect the rights, safety, and legitimate interests of Regalla and its customers.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Any handling or disclosure of personal information must have an appropriate legal basis and be consistent with applicable data protection requirements.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>6. Data Storage and Security</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla takes reasonable measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or loss.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Information submitted through email may be stored in the email systems used by the customer and Regalla. Any additional information collected through the website will be handled according to the applicable security and data management practices.
                </p>

                <p>
                    However, no method of electronic transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla retains personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this policy, respond to inquiries, manage order-related matters, and comply with applicable legal obligations.
                </p>

                <p>
                    When personal information is no longer necessary, it will be securely deleted, anonymized, or disposed of, as appropriate and permitted by law.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>8. Cookies and Website Technologies</h2>

                <p>
                    Our website may use cookies or similar technologies to support basic functionality and understand how visitors interact with its pages, if these technologies are implemented.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Cookies are small files stored on your device that may help a website remember certain preferences or usage information.
                </p>

                <p>
                    You may manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. However, disabling certain cookies may affect some website functions.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>9. Your Data Privacy Rights</h2>

                <p>
                    Under applicable Philippine data privacy laws, you may have the right to:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Be informed about how your personal information is collected and used.</li>
                    <li>Request access to your personal information.</li>
                    <li>Request the correction of inaccurate or outdated information.</li>
                    <li>Request the blocking, removal, or destruction of personal information when legally justified.</li>
                    <li>Object to certain types of processing, where applicable.</li>
                    <li>File a complaint with the appropriate authority if you believe your privacy rights have been violated.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    To exercise your rights, you may contact Regalla using the contact details provided below. Requests will be handled in accordance with applicable laws and any relevant legal limitations.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>10. Third-Party Links</h2>

                <p>
                    Our website may contain links to external websites or services. These third-party platforms operate independently and may have their own privacy policies and practices.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Regalla is not responsible for the privacy practices of external websites. We encourage visitors to review the privacy policies of any third-party platforms they access.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla's website is intended for its target audience of shoppers aged 16 and above. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13 without the legally required authorization.
                </p>

                <p>
                    If we become aware that personal information has been collected from a child in circumstances that violate applicable laws, we will take appropriate steps to address the matter.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

                <p>
                    Regalla may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in its website, business practices, or applicable legal requirements.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Any revisions will be published on this page along with an updated revision date. We encourage visitors to review this policy periodically.
                </p>
            </section>


            <section>
                <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>

                <p>
                    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data privacy rights, you may contact Regalla through the following channels:
                </p>

